      "id": "U05-S1",
      "title": "Trolley with applied force and resistance",
      "stimulus": "A 2.0 kg trolley is already moving at 2.0 m/s on a level track. Over the next 4.0 m, a constant 10 N horizontal pulling force acts forward while a constant 3.0 N resistive force acts backward. Assume both forces remain constant, vertical forces balance, and no other forces perform work."
    }
