      "topic": "Kinetic energy derivation",
      "stem": "A constant net force accelerates a body of mass m from speed u to speed v through a straight-line displacement d. Using Fnet = ma and v² − u² = 2ad, what is the net work?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "m(v² − u²)"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "½m(v − u)²"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "½m(v² − u²)"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "m(v − u)/d"
        }
      ]
    },
